### 1. Initiate Payment Transaction (POST)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "ORDER-1001",
  "amount": 1499.00,
  "currency": "INR",
  "customerId": "CUSTOMER-501",
  "idempotencyKey": "ORDER-1001-PAYMENT-1"
}

###

### 2. Initiate Payment Transaction with Random Demo Data (POST)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/payments/demo/random

###

### 3. Get List of All Payment Transactions (GET)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/payments

###

### 4. Get Single Payment Transaction Details by ID (GET)
# Replace {transactionId} with actual ID returned from Initiate Payment
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/payments/replace-with-transaction-id

###

### 5. Receive Asynchronous Webhook Status Update from Gateway (POST)
# Replace transactionId and gatewayPaymentId with actual values from step 1
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/payments/webhooks/RAZORPAY
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transactionId": "replace-with-transaction-id",
  "gatewayPaymentId": "razorpay_pay_generated-id",
  "status": "SUCCESS",
  "failureReason": null
}

###

### 6. Get Health Status of All Payment Gateways (GET)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/gateways/health

###

### 7. Get Health Status of Specific Gateway (GET)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/gateways/RAZORPAY/health

###

### 8. Manually Reset Gateway Health to HEALTHY (POST)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/gateways/RAZORPAY/reset-health

###

### 9. Update Gateway Routing Weight (PATCH)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/gateways/STRIPE/weight
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "weight": 60
}

###
